{title: Chaudhvin Ka Chaand Ho}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Ravi}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Chaudhvi ka chand ho ya aftab ho
[G]Jo bhi ho tum, [D]khuda ki qasam,
[G]lajavab ho
[G]Zulfen hain jaise kandhe pe
[C]badal [G]jhuke hue
[G]Ankhen hain jaise meay ke
[C]payale [G]bhare hue
[C]Masti hai jis [D]me pyaar ki tum,
[G]vo sharab ho
[G]Chehra hai jaise jheel me
[C]khilata [D]hua kanval
[G]Ya zindagi ke saaj pe
[C]chhedi [G]hui gazal
[C]Jane bahar [D]tum kisi
[D]shayar ka [G]khwab ho
[G]Honthon pe khelti hain
[C]tabassum [G]ki bijliyan
[G]Sajade tumhaari raah men
[C]karti [G]hain kehkashan
[C]Duniya-e-husn-o-ishq [D]ka
[D]tum hi [G]shabab ho
